  "enable": "Cache the Face_decals material slot before mutation: imported names can disappear after texture changes. Set the color atlas as base color, separate opacityAtlasPath as PhysicallyBasedMaterial.Opacity scalar texture with scale 1, transparent blending, white tint and opacity threshold 0.5. Base-color alpha alone is insufficient in the tested RealityRenderer path. Set scale/offset from the selected cell. Apply face_decals=1 to hide 3D mouths/brows, and per-eye hidden morphs from this cell. Keep skinned geometry, ear/posture/lid morphs and open-eye joints.",
